// The ids Apple and Google give the iPhone app, all in one place (the
// Android ones are in android/app/src/main/res/values/play-ids.xml).
//
// ICEDASH_ADMOB_APP_ID: AdMob → Apps → Ice Dash: Penguin Slide (iOS) → App
//   settings, "App ID" (ca-app-pub-…~…; added 3 Nov 2026). Google's sample
//   iOS app id is ca-app-pub-3940256099942544~1458002511; the Mobile Ads SDK
//   stops the app at launch without one. The rewarded ad unit ("Revive and
//   double") is in js/native.js, AD_UNIT_IOS.
// ICEDASH_BOARD_FREERIDE: App Store Connect → the app → Game Center →
//   Leaderboards → Freeride, its Leaderboard ID. Empty, the app has no
//   board and shows no button for one (GameCenterPlugin.swift).
ICEDASH_ADMOB_APP_ID = ca-app-pub-6104904420104536~5953442824
ICEDASH_BOARD_FREERIDE = freeride
